# 🚀 Fully Automated Jenkins + Ansible + Docker Worker (Terraform)

This project automatically provisions:

✔ Jenkins Master  
✔ Jenkins Worker (with Docker)  
✔ Ansible Control Node  
✔ All nodes inside 1 VPC  
✔ All nodes hardened (UFW + Fail2Ban + SSH hardening)  
✔ Jenkins worker auto-registers via SSH  
✔ No manual setup required  
✔ Fully automated using Terraform + cloud-init + Ansible  

---

## 📦 Infrastructure Created

| Component | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| **Control Node** | Runs Ansible automatically, configures all machines |
| **Jenkins Master** | Auto-installs Jenkins + admin user + auto-bootstrap |
| **Jenkins Worker** | Auto-installs Java + Docker + auto-registers to master |
| **Security** | UFW, fail2ban, SSH hardening, sudo devops user |
| **SSH** | Automatically generated & injected into all nodes |

---

